#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/portal/common.js:163
msgid ""
"The portal is switched off. Turn on \"Enable portal\" above, then press "
"\"Save & Apply\" to start it."
msgstr "门户已关闭。请打开上方的「启用门户」，再点「保存并应用」启动它。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/portal/common.js:168
msgid ""
"The portal is not serving requests. Change a setting and use \"Save & "
"Apply\" to restart it; if the port stays unbound, another service may "
"already be using it."
msgstr ""
"门户当前没有在提供服务。修改任一设置后点「保存并应用」重启服务；若端口仍未绑"
"定，可能有其他服务已占用该端口。"

